<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CHILLERS UPS MAIDEN SHR, DECLARES DIV.</title>
<headline>CHILLERS UPS MAIDEN SHR, DECLARES DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	10.4	vs    7.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		     3	vs    nil</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    2.24	vs    1.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    3.01	vs    1.83</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.77	vs    0.61 </p>
<p>    Interest paid	    2.95	vs    1.19</p>
<p>    Turnover		  51.92	vs    33.11</p>
<p>Div payable July 2</p>
<p>on register May 30</p>
<p>Full name: Chillers Group Ltd (food)</p>
<p>NOTE - Chillers said shareholders may elect to recieve</p>
<p>capitalisation shares in lieu of a dividend. It said it was</p>
<p>investigating opening depots in the Northern Province and</p>
<p>Eastern Cape in addition to upgrading its present distribution</p>
<p>centres.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
